  "Specification": "This module, APChannel, provides Apalache type annotations for the Channel module, which is used in various chapters of the Specifying Systems repository. It introduces a constant Data, representing a set of DATUM values, and a variable chan, which is a record with fields val, rdy, and ack. The module instantiates Channel and provides a concrete value for Data (DataVal) for use in model checking. The module itself does not define any algorithms or temporal properties, but serves as a typed wrapper for the underlying Channel specification.",
